<!--
  DET Preview Theme — the toolkit's one independent, reusable Hyvä child theme for rendering and
  QA-ing converter-generated CMS/UI output (issue #28). "Independent" means independent from any
  customer/child theme code and from local theme configuration — it still lawfully extends the
  licensed Hyvä base theme installed in the operator's own checkout (parent: Hyva/default). This
  is NOT a theme per conversion: one preview theme serves every conversion run; its scoped CSS is
  a portable handoff artifact, never a customer-theme target.

  Scope (product policy, docs/specs/PRODUCT-ARCHITECTURE-AND-SCOPE.md "two DISTINCT deliverables"):
  - Native Page Builder CMS content renders through the platform's own structural markup and the
    Hyvä base theme's Page Builder support; this theme adds ONLY scoped presentational CSS.
  - Site chrome (header/footer/navigation) is inherited from the Hyvä base theme; fidelity deltas
    vs. the design's chrome are recorded in the run's gap report, never coded into a client theme.
-->
<theme xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
       xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:framework:Config/etc/theme.xsd">
    <title>DET Preview Theme</title>
    <parent>Hyva/default</parent>
</theme>
